# A signed-in player on the local platform: a private table with two AI
# opponents, Start, the room-bound session refereed by server.js, shoving
# every turn until the match's result and the leaderboard line.
# viewport 1280x720
until 900 =Quick Play
frames 30
save online-menu
click =More AI opponents
frames 30
click =More AI opponents
frames 30
click =Private Table
until 900 Start table
frames 60
save online-lobby
click =Start table
until 1800 Pot
frames 60
save online-table
repeat 36000 until Winner:
  key KeyA 2
  frames 30
end
frames 400
save online-over
